### ============ 18. 附件(YPJ-50;presign 直传,字节不经后端) ============
### ============================================================

### 注册附件元数据并取上传 URL(handler 存 attachmentId;uploadUrl 用 curl 直传:
###   curl -X PUT -H "Content-Type: application/pdf" --upload-file 本地文件 "<uploadUrl>")
POST {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "spec-0063.pdf",
  "contentType": "application/pdf",
  "sizeBytes": 102400
}

> {%
    client.global.set("attachmentId", response.body.attachmentId);
%}

### 附件列表
GET {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 取下载 URL(curl -o 取回:"<downloadUrl>")
GET {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/attachments/{{attachmentId}}/download-url
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 删除附件(行删 + 存储对象删;204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/attachments/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [预期 400] 超限(sizeBytes > max-size-mb,默认 20MB)
POST {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "big.pdf",
  "contentType": "application/pdf",
  "sizeBytes": 999999999999
}

### [预期 400] 非法扩展(白名单外)
POST {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "virus.exe",
  "contentType": "application/x-msdownload",
  "sizeBytes": 1024
}

### [预期 404] 补挂未入册分支(只可补挂 yangzhou 已关联的分支;repo 取建分支回填的实际挂载仓)
POST {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/git-refs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repo": "{{attachRepo}}",
  "ref": "no-such-branch"
}

### [预期 409] 重复补挂(同票同分支连发两次,第二次中)
POST {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId2}}/git-refs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repo": "{{attachRepo}}",
  "ref": "{{attachRef}}"
}

### [预期 409] PR 行不可补挂(ref 是 PR 号而非分支;需该 PR 已被轮询入册,未入册则 404)
POST {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/git-refs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repo": "{{attachRepo}}",
  "ref": "1001"
}
